    "dictation": "Rigorous academic research regarding behavioral neurology & neurodegeneration requires precise experimental controls and empirical data validation.",
    "readAloud": "Interdisciplinary research in behavioral neurology & neurodegeneration fosters innovative solutions to complex global challenges.",
